segments.en:
Laws of the Firstborn Donkey — Halacha Two

:root {

--parchment: #f5ead6;

--ink: #2c1a0e;

--red: #8b1a1a;

--gold: #8b6914;

--border: #c4a45a;

--shadow: rgba(44,26,14,0.18);

* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {

background: #3a2a18;

background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 2px, rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 4px);

font-family: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;

color: var(--ink);

min-height: 100vh;

padding: 40px 20px;

.page {

max-width: 820px;

margin: 0 auto;

background: var(--parchment);

background-image:

radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 10%, rgba(180,140,80,0.12) 0%, transparent 60%),

radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 90%, rgba(180,140,80,0.10) 0%, transparent 60%);

border: 2px solid var(--border);

border-radius: 4px;

box-shadow: 0 8px 40px var(--shadow), inset 0 0 80px rgba(200,160,80,0.08);

padding: 60px 70px;

.series-label {

text-align: center;

font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;

font-size: 12px;

letter-spacing: 3px;

text-transform: uppercase;

color: var(--gold);

margin-bottom: 10px;

.main-title {

text-align: center;

font-family: 'Cinzel Decorative', serif;

font-size: 24px;

color: var(--red);

line-height: 1.3;

margin-bottom: 6px;

.subtitle {

text-align: center;

font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;

font-size: 14px;

color: var(--gold);

margin-bottom: 6px;

.halacha-title {

text-align: center;

font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;

font-size: 17px;

color: var(--ink);

margin: 30px 0 8px 0;

padding-bottom: 8px;

border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);

.divider {

text-align: center;

color: var(--border);

font-size: 20px;

margin: 18px 0;

letter-spacing: 8px;

.cross-ref {

font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;

font-size: 11.5px;

color: var(--gold);

text-align: center;

margin-bottom: 24px;

letter-spacing: 0.3px;

.opening-verse {

text-align: center;

font-style: italic;

color: var(--red);

font-size: 16.5px;

margin: 0 0 24px 0;

.section-marker {

font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;

font-size: 13px;

color: var(--gold);

margin: 28px 0 10px 0;

border-left: 3px solid var(--border);

padding-left: 12px;

letter-spacing: 1px;

font-size: 17px;

line-height: 1.85;

margin-bottom: 16px;

text-align: justify;

text-indent: 2em;

p.no-indent { text-indent: 0; }

em { font-style: italic; color: #4a2a10; }

.section-note {

font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;

font-size: 11px;

color: var(--gold);

border-top: 1px solid var(--border);

margin-top: 40px;

padding-top: 14px;

text-align: center;

letter-spacing: 0.5px;

@media (max-width: 600px) {

.page { padding: 36px 24px; }

.main-title { font-size: 18px; }

p { font-size: 15.5px; }

Likutay Halachos · Yoreh De'ah, Part Two

Laws of the Firstborn Donkey

Hilchos Petter Chamor
